# =============================================================================
# AGAP — Docker Build Context Exclusions
# =============================================================================
# Without this file, the 1.42 GB node_modules from the host get sent to the
# Docker daemon and then overwrite the pnpm-installed modules inside the
# container when "COPY . ." runs, causing prisma/build/index.js to go missing.

# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# --- Build outputs ---
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/build
**/out

# --- Test / coverage ---
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# --- Git ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- IDE / editor ---
.vscode
.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# --- OS ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/*.log

# --- Environment files (never bake secrets into images) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Local dev tooling (not needed inside the image) ---
.claude
docs
scripts
tests
infrastructure
*.md

# --- Mobile (not needed for backend image) ---
mobile

# --- Frontend build artefacts (source is needed for workspace resolution) ---
frontend/.next
frontend/out
